codex
There’s a useful simplification from Xu’s own proof: on a fixed tree, equation (4.3) gives `I + IM = deg_y f + weighted_minor + (Im-1)`, so the Theorem 4.7(i) slack equals the Corollary 5.3 slack. I’m patching the driver to use that identity and optimize the one same-tree scalar `IM-Im`; the exact `I` formula is then a checked identity, not an extra independent frontier.
