I’m patching the scalar path to mirror `XuBounder.option_bound`: choose the zero multiplicity `b`, build one option per nonzero orbit value, and use a cached multiset optimizer for the remaining sum. This keeps the same selected-zero/selected-nonzero embedding cases as the charged driver.
