+## 6. Xu calibration
+
+The manual split calibrations compute `IM`, `Im`, exact tree `I`, weighted
+minor sum, and both slacks.  The Theorem 4.7(i) slack equals `IM-Im` in each
+case, as predicted by (*).
+
+| case | `IM` | `Im` | `I` | weighted minor | slack | result |
